// Assay configuration for the Shaffer et al. (2022) extraction-comparison
// cohort (Qiita 12201, ENA ERP124610; TRI-REAL-05).
//
// The study used the Earth Microbiome Project protocols recorded in its ENA
// library_construction_protocol fields:
//   16S: 515F (Parada) / 806R (Apprill), V4, single-end MiSeq reads
//   ITS: ITS1f / ITS2, ITS1 region, single-end MiSeq reads
// In EMP libraries the gene-specific primer is part of the sequencing primer,
// so reads normally start after it; cutadapt keeps reads without a primer
// match. ITSxpress must extract ITS1, not the default ITS2.
//
// `triarchy real-world --dataset TRI-REAL-05` applies this file automatically.
params {
    cutadapt_16s_forward = 'GTGYCAGCMGCCGCGGTAA'
    cutadapt_16s_reverse = 'GGACTACNVGGGTWTCTAAT'
    cutadapt_its_forward = 'CTTGGTCATTTAGAGGAAGTAA'
    cutadapt_its_reverse = 'GCTGCGTTCTTCATCGATGC'
    itsxpress_region = 'ITS1'
}
